# Smart Notes Ultra V4

Smart Notes Ultra adalah aplikasi catatan berbasis Python dan PyQt5.

## Features

* Multi Tabs
* Folder System
* Rename Folder
* Move Notes
* Pin Notes
* Favorite Notes
* Export TXT
* Export PDF
* Auto Save
* Dark Mode
* Multiple Themes

## Requirements

* Python 3.11+
* PyQt5
* reportlab

## Run


pip install PyQt5 reportlab
python Ultra_Smart_Notes_V4.py

